1. Vizro visual vocabulary chart recipes
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/mckinsey/vizro
Path:    vizro-core/examples/visual-vocabulary/pages/examples/
License: Apache License 2.0
Used in: src/charts.py

The mekko() builder in src/charts.py is adapted from Vizro's marimekko.py. The
variable-width stacked bar approach (normalised widths plus cumulative x
positions) originates there. Our version strips the Vizro @capture decorator,
replaces an implicit pandas index alignment with an explicit merge, adds a
pre-aggregation guard, and derives annotation placement from the data instead of
hardcoding it.

