5. Natural Earth (1:110m physical land)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:  https://www.naturalearthdata.com
         via https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector
License: Public domain. No permission, fee or attribution is required.

Recorded anyway, because a committed asset with no stated source is the thing
this repository refuses everywhere else.

`web/public/geo/land.json` is a simplification rather than the original: outer
rings only, coordinates rounded to one decimal degree, polygons under three
degrees dropped, nothing south of 60S. `scripts/make_basemap.py` performs the
reduction and documents what it costs. The file backs the corridor map in
`web/components/CorridorMap.tsx`, whose airport positions come from OurAirports
above.
